From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dreyk <dreyksmail@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 19:40:43 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mt76: mt76x02: optional skip of tx status polling in
 napi

In mt76x02_poll_tx(), the driver calls mt76x02_mac_poll_tx_status() at the
start of each TX NAPI poll cycle. Each poll issues two 32-bit PCIe reads
(MT_TX_STAT_FIFO_EXT and MT_TX_STAT_FIFO), taking ~2.7 us per poll.

During a 22.6 s UDP burst, NAPI executes 50,608 polls, virtually all of
which find an empty hardware FIFO because hardware interrupt MT_INT_TX_STAT
already drains valid status entries into dev->txstatus_fifo, and the TX
worker drains both the hardware FIFO and the software FIFO.

Add a run-time debugfs switch tx_skip_napi_stat (/sys/kernel/debug/
ieee80211/phy1/mt76/tx_skip_napi_stat, default 0). When enabled,
mt76x02_poll_tx() skips polling the hardware status FIFO. Status entries
continue to be retrieved via the MT_INT_TX_STAT hard interrupt and processed
by the TX worker.

This eliminates ~50,600 redundant FIFO polls (~101,200 PCIe reads, ~137 ms
CPU time per 22.6 s run).
---
 mt76x02.h         | 1 +
 mt76x02_debugfs.c | 2 ++
 mt76x02_mmio.c    | 3 ++-
 3 files changed, 5 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/mt76x02.h b/mt76x02.h
index ae2246bc..33f8bc72 100644
--- a/mt76x02.h
+++ b/mt76x02.h
@@ -132,6 +132,7 @@ struct mt76x02_dev {
 	bool enable_tpc;
 	bool tx_skip_idle;
 	bool tx_skip_complete_stat;
+	bool tx_skip_napi_stat;
 
 	bool no_2ghz;
 
diff --git a/mt76x02_debugfs.c b/mt76x02_debugfs.c
index 670d4d01..b3658f59 100644
--- a/mt76x02_debugfs.c
+++ b/mt76x02_debugfs.c
@@ -145,6 +145,8 @@ void mt76x02_init_debugfs(struct mt76x02_dev *dev)
 	debugfs_create_bool("tx_no_reread", 0600, dir, &dev->mt76.tx_no_reread);
 	debugfs_create_bool("tx_skip_complete_stat", 0600, dir,
 			    &dev->tx_skip_complete_stat);
+	debugfs_create_bool("tx_skip_napi_stat", 0600, dir,
+			    &dev->tx_skip_napi_stat);
 
 	debugfs_create_file("edcca", 0600, dir, dev, &fops_edcca);
 	debugfs_create_file("ampdu_stat", 0400, dir, dev, &mt76x02_ampdu_stat_fops);
diff --git a/mt76x02_mmio.c b/mt76x02_mmio.c
index a0aac1a5..e0906ab2 100644
--- a/mt76x02_mmio.c
+++ b/mt76x02_mmio.c
@@ -194,7 +194,8 @@ static int mt76x02_poll_tx(struct napi_struct *napi, int budget)
 					       mt76.tx_napi);
 	int i;
 
-	mt76x02_mac_poll_tx_status(dev, false);
+	if (!READ_ONCE(dev->tx_skip_napi_stat))
+		mt76x02_mac_poll_tx_status(dev, false);
 
 	mt76x02_clean_tx_queue(dev, dev->mt76.q_mcu[MT_MCUQ_WM]);
 	for (i = MT_TXQ_PSD; i >= 0; i--)
